"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 1951 to 2025, and on the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids January to February came in under 90% of normal in 35 of 75 years. In 2025 the middle sat at 63% of normal for August to September and 51% for January to February. In 2026 so far, March to April came in at 214% of normal on the middle. Grid 27479 had its driest year in 1953 at 65%.</p>"}
